/2025</b></span></li>\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date :<b>19/09/2025</b></li>\n<li>BPSC AES Exam Date :<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b> 11/06/2026</b></span></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <b>04/06/2026</b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 46.3311%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>General / BC/ Other State : <b>100/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST / PH : <b>100/-</b></li>\n<li>Female Candidate (Bihar Dom.) : <b>100/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through Online / Offline Fee Mode Only</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 92.1779%;\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>BPSC AES Notification 2025 : </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Age Limit as on 01/08/2025</b></span></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>18 Years</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>37 Male</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>40 Female</b></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per BPSC AES Assistant Environmental Scientist Examination Rules Advt No 88/2025.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 92.1779%;\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>BPSC AES Recruitment 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Vacancy Details Total : 17 Post</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 22.1779%;\" colspan=\"3\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 23.6689%;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Total Post</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 46.3311%;\" colspan=\"5\"><strong>BPSC Assistant Environmental Scientist Exam Eligibility</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.1779%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\">Assistant Environmental Scientist</td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.6689%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\">17</td>\n<td style=\"width: 46.3311%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Post Graduate Degree in Chemistry, Biology, Environmental Science, or Physics is mandatory.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">More Eligibility Details Read the Notification</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 92.1779%;\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>BPSC AES Notification 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Category Wise Vacancy Details</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 12.1779%;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: center;\"><strong>UR</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: center;\"><strong>EWS</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.6689%; text-align: center;\"><strong>EBC</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 6.33106%; text-align: center;\"><strong>BC</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: center;\"><strong>BC Female</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: center;\"><strong>SC</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: center;\"><strong>ST</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Total</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 12.1779%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\">Assistant Environmental Scientist</td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: center;\">07</td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: center;\">02</td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.6689%; text-align: center;\">03</td>\n<td style=\"width: 6.33106%; text-align: center;\">02</td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: center;\">0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: center;\">02</td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: center;\">01</td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: center;\">17</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 92.1779%;\" colspan=\"10\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>Bihar Public Service Commission BPSC Are Issued AES Assistant Environmental Scientist Examination 2026. Notification and Invited Online Application Form for the BPSC AES Assistant Environmental Scientist Recruitment 2026 Candidate Can Apply Online for <b>27/08/2025 to 19/09/2025.</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the BPSC Latest Recruitment 2026 Application Form in Sarkari Result Recruitment Latest Job Section.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Hand Writing, Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID, Thumb, Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 92.1779%;\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 92.1779%;\" colspan=\"10\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 45.8468%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 46.3311%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 92.1779%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 45.8468%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Admit Card</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 46.3311%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://bpsconline.bihar.gov.in/candidate/login\"><b>Link Will be Activate on 04/06/2026</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 45.8468%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Exam Notice</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 46.3311%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/wp-content/uploads/BPSC_content/Notices/Important-Notice-882025-Asst.-Environmental-Scientist-Admit-Card_BPSC-20260602-se6ft5.pdf\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 45.8468%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Apply Online</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 46.3311%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><a title=\"Apply Online Registration for BPSC 71th Exam 2025\" href=\"https://bpsconline.bihar.gov.in/candidate/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Notification</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"BPSC 72\" href=\"https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/wp-content/uploads/BPSC_content/Notices/22-8-25-5-Advertisement-882025-Assistant-Environmental-Scientist-Environment-Forest-Climate-Change-Dept_BPSC-20250823-326r9c.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Syllabus</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"BPSC 72\" href=\"https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/wp-content/uploads/BPSC_content/Notices/22-8-25-7-Syllabus-882025-Assistant-Environmental-Scientist-Environment-Forest-Climate-Change-Dept_BPSC-20250823-kuog68.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008080;\"><b>Signature Resizer, PDF Compress, Age Calculator and More Tools</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 45.8468%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Official Website</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 46.3311%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><a title=\"BPSC Official Website\" href=\"https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BPSC Official Website</a></b></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6da1cb96\">\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-325acb59\"><span class=\"gb-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"gb-headline-text\"><strong><em>Frequently Asked Questions</em></strong></span></h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-97950a91 gb-headline-text\"><p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-22310 size-full\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201491%20982'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"Admit Card for Bihar BPSC AES Exam 2026\" width=\"1491\" height=\"982\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Bihar-AES-2026.jpg 1491w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Bihar-AES-2026-300x198.jpg 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Bihar-AES-2026-1024x674.jpg 1024w